*   &reset @WIRE(mode="straight") {%port2::pin #XRESET:2};
*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight", linestyle="dashed") {#XRESET:4 (115, -19) (115, -22) %j19};
*   &vout @WIRE(mode="straight") {%port10::pin %j20};
*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight") {#XU5:2 %j5};
