*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight") {%j5 %j4};
*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight") {#XRESET:3 %j19 %j12};
*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight") {%j12 (121, -36) #CDUMMY:2};
*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight") {%port1::pin %j17};
*   &vss @WIRE(mode="straight") {#XU0:2 %j17};
